WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.660
Now we meet a new cast
of characters: white settlers.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.730
In Bingham's Daniel Boone Escorting Settlers,
in Ranney's trail scenes,

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.970
the West becomes a stage
with its lead actors finally in place:

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.870
determined families, rugged individuals,

5
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.930
wagon trains drifting
steadily toward the horizon.

6
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.190
Watch what these scenes are doing.

7
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.030
The land seems to welcome them.

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.730
The atmosphere feels blessed,
almost ordained.

9
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.050
Conflict rarely enters the frame.
